{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e03-scene-01",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "ずーっといてね  (Please Stay Here Forever)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "mama": "ママ",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Episode three opens in Tokyo in 1982, where fugitive Muranishi is lying low in the apartment of a kind hostess. Annoyed at first by his noisy electronic game as she gets ready for work, she softens and tells him she does not care about his past. Listen to the Japanese first, then we'll go through it together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "うち、今から仕事なんだからさ。そこ邪魔なの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "もう、ピコピコうるさいなあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "みんなそのおもちゃに夢中なんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "ねえ、あんたが転がり込んできて結構たつじゃない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すまん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "いや、そういう意味じゃないの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "うち、いいんだ。あんたがどこの誰でも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "訳ありでも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "だからさ、ずーっといてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "ねえ、じゃ行ってくるね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、気をつけて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "いってきまーす。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "うち、今から仕事なんだからさ。そこ邪魔なの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have to go to work right now, so you're in the way there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "もう、ピコピコうるさいなあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Geez, all that beeping is so noisy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "みんなそのおもちゃに夢中なんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone is so obsessed with that toy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "ねえ、あんたが転がり込んできて結構たつじゃない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, quite some time has passed since you came crashing in here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すまん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "いや、そういう意味じゃないの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, that's not what I mean.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "うち、いいんだ。あんたがどこの誰でも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't mind at all, no matter who you are or where you're from.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "訳ありでも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if you have a complicated past.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "だからさ、ずーっといてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So please stay here forever, okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "ねえ、じゃ行ってくるね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, well then, I'm heading off.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、気をつけて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, take care.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "いってきまーす。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Off I go!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
